Z||000000||TalShino||03-20-2000||05:42 PM||||I have a 88 coupe... 2.5liter.. when I put on my brakes going about 55 theres like a clanking noise that seems to be coming from my front suspension... sounds like its coming from the passenger side but I'm not sure.. What could this possibly be? I've checked and made sure everythings tight.. HELP!||||reg||5
