Z||000003||batboy||03-20-2000||08:43 PM||||Maybe a worn suspension part? I don't know, just guessing. I'm assuming you checked the caliper slider bolts. Also check things like shocks, control arm bushings, wheel bearings, ball joints, and inner tie rods.||||reg||1
Z||000004||TalShino||03-20-2000||08:47 PM||||thats what I think it is, the bushing and things are bad.. car has 124k miles on it, and was a 'parts car' when I bought it and bright it back to life.. guess I'll add redoing my front suspension to my list of summer fixes on my car..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Thnx||||reg||1
