Z||000008||turbo86se||03-21-2000||12:04 PM||||I'm with you again, TalShino, my 88 coupe was wrecked and abandoned when I discovered it. A beautiful T-Top coupe saved from the junk yard!!! It's got 116K on it, with original suspension. I know it's bad, push down on it, it moves up and down like an old Caddy! Still handles like it's on rails! Not like the Caddy!  I only hear the clanking at low speeds, too. Usually I can "feel" it through the brake petal.  <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000009||ChadMan||03-21-2000||12:13 PM||||My 88 Coupe's brakes don't clank, but they creak as you gently apply and release them.  I've heard other 88's do the same thing, so I'm not too worried.<P>The only clank I ever heard from the front end of my 88 was caused by a broken swaybar link.  But that noise came if I hit a bump while turning, not while braking.<P>Keep us posted!||||reg||1
Z||000010||deceler8||03-21-2000||12:46 PM||||Even though it may sound as if it's coming from the front, check the passenger side rear brake caliper to be sure both bolts are tight and/or present.<P>I had a similar clank coming from the passenger side and one of the brake caliper mounting bolts was missing on the rear.||||reg||1
Z||000011||TalShino||03-21-2000||01:22 PM||||I'll check that when I go to 'play' with my baby (Lil Kit) in a few minutes, I normally hear the clank when the brake is halfway pressed.. if I barely press it no clank and when its to the floor  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> no clank.. I'm gonna check that rear caliper.. Thnx..<P>TalShino - 'Lil Kit'||||reg||1
Z||000012||ChadMan||03-21-2000||01:37 PM||||Hey 88 brakers, do any of your cars pull left or right under heavy braking?  My car is well-aligned, and under light to moderate braking, it stops nice and straight.  But under heavy braking, the car pulls left and the left front wheel locks long before the others do.  <P>I'm guessing I should replace the rubber hoses to the front brakes.  What do you guys think?  Hoses?  Calipers?  Voodoo?||||reg||8
Z||000013||batboy||03-21-2000||07:36 PM||||Hoses.||||reg||1
